{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（11日）上午11時39分，警方接報一名男工人在深水埗汝州街228至230號高處墮下，倒臥平台。救援人員到場時傷者昏迷不醒，隨即將他送往明愛醫院搶救。</p><p>據報，事發時數名工人在天台的棚架上工作，事主佩戴安全帶並安裝好「狗臂架」，其間突然連人帶「狗臂架」由高處墮下，直墜約7層樓下的平台，重創昏迷。在場同事見狀大驚，隨即報警求助。</p><figure><img alt=\"天台搭有棚架。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175062453013188608740519.jpeg/g9y0r5X9q3I6yIu_6FvwtKdFvWJEoUlSiQhUfawIVH0\"/><figcaption>天台搭有棚架。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175062301573648384895416.jpeg/snXd_A8uN7JAm-cY2WMMfT0pDxsbZLpdXFAoeXlQKHk\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工人到場搭棚。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175068240825552896367842.jpeg/02KrrAR9wJpmsXdR6ksH55wcITUhzIHlG1-bVxtfm1c\"/><figcaption>工人到場搭棚。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175062305092800512472601.jpeg/zksggBnlWqAlPaBPCunrHEa8oxuo6K7gy_je9e743vU\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"天台搭有棚架。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175062307785674752024375.jpeg/W248XnE_6Uxkj4kK1fPZPd9xv2Bg3R8FQrxNn2e8TZ8\"/><figcaption>天台搭有棚架。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大廈頂樓另一單位的外牆，亦搭有棚架做工程。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175062952881950720165740.jpeg/1uZLP865BQTM4A_BAOi92zoMrfRmU3bQJewZ9ADsGfQ\"/><figcaption>大廈頂樓另一單位的外牆，亦搭有棚架做工程。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175057953368182784893514.jpeg/pbMG-DZQOzFaiqkD0FCV5Yg0BKuAtVUtmhtHa78bR2s\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175057950511730688714536.jpeg/D6yfxirjKFm5zoECtEooHycB5siyDGyhCwzQHC4M0Bw\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T05:18:43.528730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}